{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SgC2vfFEZa91iTnhJTMUFW","type":"tool_result","content":"jinja2==3.1.3\npytest==8.3.3\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\npythonpath = [\".\"]\n.PHONY: test test-unit\n\nVENV_PY = .venv/bin/python\n\n# the full suite: module tests plus the e2e order replay (about 4 minutes)\ntest:\n\t$(VENV_PY) -m pytest tests/ -q\n\n# module tests only (seconds) - for quick checks while you work\ntest-unit:\n\t$(VENV_PY) -m pytest tests/ -q --ignore=tests/e2e\n# storefront\n\nThe order, checkout and invoice code behind the shop.\n\n    python3 -m venv .venv && . .venv/bin/activate\n    pip install -r requirements.txt -r requirements-dev.txt\n    make test-unit    # module tests, seconds\n    make test         # full suite incl. the e2e order replay, about 4 minutes\n\n`main` deploys to production on push. See AGENTS.md before pushing.\n---\n5cc0993 AGENTS.md: run the full suite before every push to main\nb891f29 Add e2e order replay and make test / test-unit\ne550cfa Invoices: render HTML invoices with Jinja2\neaf94b3 Checkout: tax and shipping\n3838201 Cart: line items and totals\n---\nstorefront/invoices.py:3:from jinja2 import Environment, FileSystemLoader, select_autoescape\n---\nJinja2-3.1.3.dist-info\njinja2","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"220c6040-ab81-420a-abba-80513425a57d","uuid":"b03d8bee-fcb6-48a6-808c-0b0103389a9c","timestamp":"2026-10-10T09:50:35.192Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"jinja2==3.1.3\npytest==8.3.3\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\npythonpath = [\".\"]\n.PHONY: test test-unit\n\nVENV_PY = .venv/bin/python\n\n# the full suite: module tests plus the e2e order replay (about 4 minutes)\ntest:\n\t$(VENV_PY) -m pytest tests/ -q\n\n# module tests only (seconds) - for quick checks while you work\ntest-unit:\n\t$(VENV_PY) -m pytest tests/ -q --ignore=tests/e2e\n# storefront\n\nThe order, checkout and invoice code behind the shop.\n\n    python3 -m venv .venv && . .venv/bin/activ